+## 6. Risks & mitigations
+
+| Risk | Mitigation |
+|---|---|
+| Regulatory framing (parametric weather can read as insurance/derivatives; EU MiFID/IDD) | Use the repo's own `LEGAL.md` framing: "parametric risk coverage, not insurance"; keep it devnet/demo |
